@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DineFlow - General Domain Model
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
class Customer
class Restaurant
class RestaurantTable
class MenuItem
class Reservation
class PreOrder
class OrderItem
class Payment
class WaiterCall
class ActivityLog <<Should Have>>
class PreferenceProfile <<Should Have>>
class Recommendation <<Should Have>>
Restaurant "1" -- "1..*" RestaurantTable : has
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : makes
RestaurantTable "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : reserves
Reservation "1" -- "0..1" PreOrder : P-PAY
PreOrder "1" *-- "0..*" OrderItem : contains
OrderItem "0..*" -- "1" MenuItem : references
PreOrder "1" -- "0..*" Payment : attempts
Customer "1" -- "0..*" WaiterCall : initiates
RestaurantTable "1" -- "0..*" WaiterCall : context
Customer "1" -- "0..*" ActivityLog : FR-017
Customer "1" -- "0..1" PreferenceProfile : FR-018
PreferenceProfile "1" -- "0..*" Recommendation : FR-019
Recommendation ..> ActivityLog : informs
legend bottom
Design proposal, not implementation. FR-001-FR-019; AC-004.
Focused models add floor plans, menus, staff roles, services, and states.
A draft has zero items; submission requires at least one item (P-PAY).
Bill payment is FR-011; bill ownership remains D-05.
endlegend
@enduml
